  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_1296.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La noche de este jueves en las fiestas de las calles Vila-real y adyacentes de Onda ha estado dedicada a los disfraces, con la compa&ntilde;&iacute;a de la charanga Llenya a bombo, y a la fiesta de la espuma con disco m&oacute;vil.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1292.jpg\" alt=\"img_1292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1293.jpg\" alt=\"img_1293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1294.jpg\" alt=\"img_1294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1295.jpg\" alt=\"img_1295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1296.jpg\" alt=\"img_1296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1297.jpg\" alt=\"img_1297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1298.jpg\" alt=\"img_1298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1301.jpg\" alt=\"img_1301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressescarrervila-real14/img_1302.jpg\" a